\end{equation*}
which after the usual absorption of the filter $DC$ factor
$(\tau_{u}+\tau_{v})^{-1}$ into the definition of $\phi$ reduces to the
dimensionless ratio $\kappa_{0}=1+\rho/\phi\mu$ quoted above.  With the
sign convention as written this is the signed form $\kappa_{s}=
